ular blood cells rather than serum or tumor microenvironment.\n*   **Status:** unmet.\n*   **Usefulness:** supporting.\n\nLet's construct the JSON.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"unmet\",\n  \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n  \"useful_material\": \"This study developed and validated an LC-MS/MS method for quantifying adenosine, guanosine, and inosine nucleotides (mono- and triphosphate forms) in human peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PB",
